# stdio-smoke

A portable console smoke application. It names no board, SDK, USB library, or
provider. On a platform with a console it polls connection with a fixed bound,
writes one byte message without retrying an accepted prefix, and flushes. On an
unserved host it exits successfully after receiving Unsupported from the
linkable fallback.
